{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is near, take it and check properties, or approach and move to target. Finally, perform task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />",
